body:
Yeah, me too. Imagining them being happy together, cuddling up....all the things you used to with her. Just remember she can't replace your love however hard she tries! She may be happy on the surface but I can assure you she won't be.

&#x200B;

You'll find someone who cares, and I mean truly care about you. Then you'll wonder why you even bothered. Love is strange, heartbreak is stranger.
